    "Scouting Notes": "POST DRAFT NOTES\n Has added significant strength since HS\n Displays solid average running ability\n Shows poise under pressure, “slow heartbeat”\n Battled through broken hamate bone in the CWS, still played every game\n Elite bat to ball skills with exceptionally low whiff and strikeout rates, both in and out of the zone\n Consistently puts the ball in play and keeps the game in motion.\n Lacks consistent impact; raw power is average at best, with game power closer to 40 grade.\n Uses an all fields approach and lets the barrel work naturally\n Impressed scouts with hitting approach and consistency against advanced pitching\n Steady glove at second base, with enough ability to handle shortstop in a pinch\n Not flashy, but reliable and fundamentally sound in the field\n Profiles as a solid defender capable of holding down a middle infield spot at the pro level",
